Package: nonparanormal
Title: Nonparanormal Approximation for Frugal Causal Simulation
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Daniel", "de Vassimon Manela", email = "danielmanela@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Xi", "Lin", role = "aut"),
    person("Chase", "Mathis", role = "aut"),
    person("Robin J.", "Evans", role = "aut")
    )
Description: Implements copula-based methods for causal inference using
    nonparanormal approximation. Provides tools for simulating from marginal
    structural models (MSMs) with exact causal effects by combining Bayesian
    Networks with Pair Copula Constructions (PCCs). Enables "frugal
    parameterization" where causal margins are explicitly specified.
